  {
   "id": "sec2-1",
   "section": "Other activity",
   "text": "In March 2023, Szego attended an anti-trans rally, which was organised by British anti-transgender rights activist Kellie-Jay Keen-Minshull, on the steps of the Victorian parliament house.",
   "words": 30,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 5",
    "Editor 6"
   ],
   "author_words": [
